"Nine of Pentacles" = "Sembilan Pentakel";
"The Nine of Pentacles represents self-sufficiency, luxury, and accomplishment, shown in a garden. It symbolizes independence. This card encourages enjoyment.\n\nPractically, it advises financial autonomy. It fosters gratitude. Spiritually, it highlights refinement." = "**Sembilan Pentakel** mewakili **kemandirian**, **kemewahan**, dan **pencapaian**, ditunjukkan di taman. Ia melambangkan **kebebasan**. Kad ini menggalakkan **kenikmatan**.\n\nSecara praktikal, ia menasihati **autonomi kewangan**. Ia memupuk kesyukuran. Secara rohani, ia menyerlahkan **kehalusan**.";
"Reversed, the Nine of Pentacles suggests overwork, financial dependence, or loneliness. It may indicate guardedness. Symbolically, this inversion warns of isolation.\n\nIn life, it calls for connection. Spiritually, it encourages balance." = "Dalam kedudukan terbalik, **Sembilan Pentakel** mencadangkan **kerja berlebihan**, **kebergantungan kewangan**, atau kesunyian. Ini mungkin menunjukkan **berjaga-jaga**. Secara simbolik, penyongsangan ini memberi amaran tentang **pengasingan**.\n\nDalam kehidupan, ia menyeru untuk **hubungan**. Secara rohani, ia menggalakkan **keseimbangan**.";
