"You are here to turn thought into reality. Your mind is sharp and your will is strong — a channel between the spiritual and the material. When your intention aligns with your heart, you have the power to shape your destiny. You are meant to lead through inspired action." = "Anda berada di sini untuk **menukar pemikiran menjadi realiti**. Minda anda **tajam** dan kehendak anda **kuat** — saluran antara rohani dan material. Apabila **niat anda selaras dengan hati anda**, anda mempunyai **kuasa untuk membentuk takdir anda**. Anda ditakdirkan untuk **memimpin melalui tindakan yang diinspirasikan**.";
"Your soul came to master the art of manifestation. You are learning that true power is not about control, but about conscious creation. The more you trust your divine connection, the more effortlessly your dreams take form." = "Jiwa anda datang untuk **menguasai seni manifestasi**. Anda sedang belajar bahawa **kuasa sejati bukan tentang kawalan**, tetapi tentang **penciptaan yang sedar**. Semakin anda **mempercayai hubungan ilahi anda**, semakin mudah impian anda **menjadi nyata**.";
